4ac6-9d83-453fc3dd8331"><source><g id="28">Dear <x id="29"/>,</g></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3"><g id="28">Dear <x id="29"/>,</g></mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="3"><g id="28">Thân gửi <x id="29"/>,</g></mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="3" locked="true" conf="ApprovedTranslation"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">o9cn7xaI+doXJao2F6K1PDMB6aSCIB+myKafu7jZmXQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7559818c-56bc-47a5-8d7f-4f47681c6baf"><source>Welcome to Midyear People Pulse snapshot survey</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Welcome to Midyear People Pulse snapshot survey</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Chào mừng bạn đến với khảo sát People Pulse snapshot survey giữa năm</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" conf="Translated" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 04:11:39</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 04:11:38</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">rerEhMbOMR7mlnWkvkWcnsyDkn0=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="78f63719-3afb-45e9-844b-4aaf4735fcfb"><source>Your opinion is important in helping to better understand your experience of working at the LEGO Group, supporting the People Promise to ensure everyone can succeed and grow together.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Your opinion is important in helping to better understand your experience of working at the LEGO Group, supporting the People Promise to ensure everyone can succeed and grow together.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Ý kiến của bạn đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc giúp hiểu rõ hơn trải nghiệm làm việc tại Tập Đoàn LEGO, hỗ trợ Cam Kết Nhân Viên đảm bảo mọi người đều có thể cùng nhau thành công và phát triển.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="5" conf="Translated" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 04:11:46</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 04:11:45</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">wyN9h6v3oZwtAWQKAAbNAIpfBGI=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="6e7b353b-4b69-4867-a5ed-e5f455289153"><source>You are part of the sample for ‘People Pulse snapshot survey’ (drawn randomly by Ennova, our external partner). Thank you for taking part.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">You are part of the sample for ‘People Pulse snapshot survey’ (drawn randomly by Ennova, our external partner).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Thank you for taking part.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">Bạn là một phần của mẫu khảo sát ‘People Pulse snapshot’ (được rút thăm ngẫu nhiên bởi Ennova, đối tác bên ngoài của chúng tôi).</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">Xin cảm ơn sự tham gia của bạn.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="6" conf="Translated" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 04:11:50</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 04:11:49</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">uRCUveRcFF0Yw3QAYXPMTDlKOk8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="7" conf="Translated" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">DESKTOP-HG1M5KF\Window</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 05:59:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">DESKTOP-HG1M5KF\Window</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 05:59:48</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">0jpeORVbqCyEyGF3jSIrUnBY7Bk=</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:OriginalTranslationHash">-1948357483</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="7ac0bb8e-2149-42b4-b247-200a966737ef"><source>The survey is divided into two sections and should take approximately 10 minutes to complete and the deadline for final submissions is <g id="32">June 11th</g>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">The survey is divided into two sections and should take approximately 10 minutes to complete and the deadline for final submissions is <g id="32">June 11th</g>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Khảo sát này được chia thành hai phần và sẽ mất khoảng 10 phút để hoàn thành và thời hạn nộp cuối cùng là <g id="32">ngày 11 tháng 6</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="8" conf="Translated" origin="interactive"><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 04:11:57</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 04:11:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">ZnLLxkietWZI5rIIcGzLBhPL7FQ=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d743c2da-f8a7-4a67-9ed0-62e102123553"><source>Completing the questionnaire</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Completing the questionnaire</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">Hoàn thành bảng câu hỏi</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" locked="true" conf="ApprovedTranslation"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">cJDShg2oUfSdFgO4w/35CN2VfHbLk2FloBMuutWYKwc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="024e8276-25ea-48f7-9e64-2ac499084ffc"><source>You can access the questionnaire by clicking the button below. This e-mail is personal and may not be shared with others.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">You can access the questionnaire by clicking the button below. This e-mail is personal and may not be shared with others.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">Bạn có thể truy cập bảng câu hỏi bằng cách nhấp vào nút bên dưới. Email này mang tính cá nhân và bạn không được chia sẻ nó với người khác.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="10" locked="true" conf="ApprovedTranslation"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">2+UP0ovKNHOpcbDzVsHWzVPG9B7L3fyA053oZhrpLfc=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="d2c90356-061e-4f70-a0dc-ff9ebbde0d90"><source>Your participation is voluntary. Should you find it necessary to take a break before finishing, you can always access the form again to complete it later. Your answers already provided will be saved automatically. Once you have completed your responses, you will no longer be able to go back and change them.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Your participation is voluntary. Should you find it necessary to take a break before finishing, you can always access the form again to complete it later. Your answers already provided will be saved automatically. Once you have completed your responses, you will no longer be able to go back and change them.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Việc tham gia của bạn là tự nguyện. Nếu bạn thấy cần nghỉ ngơi trước khi hoàn thành, bạn luôn có thể truy cập lại biểu mẫu này để hoàn thành sau. Câu trả lời của bạn đã cung cấp sẽ được lưu tự động và sẽ được xử lý bảo mật. Một khi bạn đã hoàn thành câu trả lời, bạn sẽ không thể quay trở lại thay đổi các câu trả lời.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="11" conf="Translated" origin="interactive" percent="97"><sdl:prev-origin origin="tm" origin-system="2k UK_UK - VI TM" percent="97"><sdl:prev-origin origin="nmt" origin-system="Machine Translation"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">H4jxZzwGw7u5Of7X13DOqHRdCcphFd9IR/JlIEdHIsA=</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 04:01:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 04:01:56</sdl:value></sdl:prev-origin><sdl:value key="last_modified_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="modified_on">05/05/2026 04:02:07</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_by">NTNVIRTUALWIN11\Tuan Ngoc Ngo</sdl:value><sdl:value key="created_on">05/05/2026 04:01:56</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SDL:ProjectTranslationHash">1517659540</sdl:value><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Mkx6suHzj9ooRkGQBYrV5tjXy6k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="1"/><sdl:cxt id="2"/><sdl:cxt id="3"/><sdl:cxt id="4"/><sdl:node id="2"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="5ebc747d-7246-47f1-b270-76ce5db35076"><source><x id="33"/> <x id="34"/> <x id="35"/> <x id="36"/> <x id="37"/> <x id="38"/>  &lt;a href=&quot;https://survey.euro.confirmit.com/wix/<x id="39"/>.aspx?r=<x id="40"/>&amp;s=<x id="41"/>&amp;DC=1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot; border: 1px solid #a9b7ac; border-radius: 3px; font-family:Trebuchet MS, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight:bold; display: inline-block;<x id="42"/></source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><x id="33"/> <x id=